          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '110816374368356719', 'username': 'VeroniqueB99', 'followers': 6156, 'following': 2126, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;100% of toots are FAKES/jokes! I am NOT a journalist. Foodie animal lover hater of haters. Positive Psychologist. Support all who don&amp;#39;t have a voice/ are shunned. American living abroad. Many citizenships. Will toot in 5 languages. Live and let live. Humor will save us all. Meme relocator. Other people&amp;#39;s opinions of you are none of your business. Was at the Pentagon on 911. You? Also &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/Alttext4me&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Alttext4me&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2023-08-01 00:00:00'}" />
