      <node id="109464308584248597" label="109464308584248597">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109464308584248597', 'username': 'Pollinators', 'followers': 1930, 'following': 3134, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;I am retired and &lt;a href=&quot;https://epicure.social/tags/gardening&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;gardening&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href=&quot;https://epicure.social/tags/Zone4b&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Zone4b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href=&quot;https://epicure.social/tags/Minnesota&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Minnesota&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. However it was Dakota territory. I am interested in &lt;a href=&quot;https://epicure.social/tags/Vegetarian&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Vegetarian&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; cooking and &lt;a href=&quot;https://epicure.social/tags/Fermentation&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Fermentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. My interests include pollinators and native plantings, &lt;a href=&quot;https://epicure.social/tags/Pollinators&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Pollinators&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://epicure.social/tags/Nature&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Nature&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://epicure.social/tags/Wildlife&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Wildlife&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://epicure.social/tags/EcologicalCollapse&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;EcologicalCollapse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://epicure.social/tags/ClimateChange&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;ClimateChange&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://epicure.social/tags/Biodiversity&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Biodiversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://epicure.social/tags/Sustainability&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Sustainability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://epicure.social/tags/Rewilding&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Rewilding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://epicure.social/tags/Hummus&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Hummus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://epicure.social/tags/Fungi&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Fungi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://epicure.social/tags/Mushrooms&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Mushrooms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.  He/him.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-24 00:00:00'}" />
