      <node id="113687571099933536" label="113687571099933536">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113687571099933536', 'username': 'RobotDiver', 'followers': 1438, 'following': 1456, 'bio': &quot;&lt;p&gt;:flag_nonbinary: :flag_transgender: 🍉 I'm a non-binary AuDHD queerdo, MECFS/POTS slogger. I make things when the spoons provide. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This account just migrated from eldritch.cafe. Federated since 2018. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I have a passion for building architectural and landscape models, language learning, native and regenerative garden design and ethical fashion design/pattern making/sewing. Anti-fascist. Anti-racist. Land Back. At my most comfortable with animals more than people.&lt;br&gt;Gus the Cat is my roommate. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I'm also a former sous chef and seagoing cook. I post often about trying to get yourself fed with low spoons/chronic illness. I share mutual aid posts when I can, but please don't tag me directly. Thx.&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, 'created_at': '2024-12-19 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
