      <node id="299282" label="299282">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '299282', 'username': 'JenWojcik', 'followers': 2829, 'following': 2699, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;***Find me on Beige.party. Posting there now***&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://beige.party/@TheJen&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;TheJen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ex Texan, New Mexican, Democrat, Redhead, GenX, Fuck maga. Fuck TERFs. Former high level engineering recruiter, serial entrepreneur. I grow fucking great weed in the southern Sacramento Mountains, remodel my cabin in the woods, fiber arts, fine art. Shroom hobbyist. Salty. Sarcastic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a question? I am happy to share. &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/AMA&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;AMA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/NewMexico&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;NewMexico&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/Cannabis&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Cannabis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/Psilocybin&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Psilocybin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/Sewing&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Sewing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/Crochet&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Crochet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/Art&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Art&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/Thrifting&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt