          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109316430682758799', 'username': 'OhMrBill', 'followers': 1191, 'following': 2432, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Hello world&lt;br&gt;🌎 Born at approx 315 PPM&lt;br&gt;47.5N,  121.7W&lt;br&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://techhub.social/tags/NorthBendWa&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;NorthBendWa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://techhub.social/tags/pnw&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;pnw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; USA 🇺🇦 🇨🇦 🇲🇽&lt;br&gt;Retired &lt;a href=&quot;https://techhub.social/tags/Teamster&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Teamster&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  / 34 yrs service. / Umarell :)&lt;br&gt;Have renewed LOVE 4 RSS feeds...&lt;br&gt;No cats except .social neighbors. / purrfect!&lt;br&gt;profile pic: Me smiling , pink &amp;amp; white &amp;amp; flowering tree.&lt;br&gt;Banner multi-color US looking flag. Says, We The People   &lt;br&gt;No license, implied or explicit, is granted to use any of my posts for training AI models.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-09 00:00:00'}" />
