          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '111887454356563174', 'username': 'Wileymiller', 'followers': 2525, 'following': 91, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Creator of the syndicated comic strip, “Non Sequitur&amp;quot;. &lt;br /&gt;If your newspaper is so horrifically bad that it doesn&amp;#39;t carry  &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/NonSequitur&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;NonSequitur&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, you can read it every day at: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gocomics.com/nonsequitur&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://www.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;gocomics.com/nonsequitur&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Then call the editor of the paper and raise hell until they carry Non Sequitur.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2024-02-07 00:00:00'}" />
