          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109253468172621220', 'username': 'jmcrookston', 'followers': 3233, 'following': 1679, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Litigator. Biochem. ♿ rights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Viruses float like smoke. Wear N95. &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/COVIDisAirborne&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;COVIDisAirborne&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;🌬️🔅&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A founder of &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.COVIDIsAirborne.org&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://www.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;COVIDIsAirborne.org&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and its-airborne.org so many years ago.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Donate to muscle.ca if you can.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Header pic is of Nicole Kidman, but instead of brush strokes, it&amp;#39;s done with typewriter characters. Done by Paul Smith, who had cerebral palsy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Profile pic &lt;a href=&quot;https://unsplash.com/photos/a-black-and-white-photo-of-a-forest-&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;unsplash.com/photos/a-black-an&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;d-white-photo-of-a-forest-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;--&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/covidisairborne.rss&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;mastodon.social/tags/covidisai&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;rborne.rss&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-10-29 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
