          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '877551', 'username': 'cavyherd', 'followers': 582, 'following': 732, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;&quot;Unity and peace are the fruits of justice—not the causes.&quot; —A.R. Moxon&lt;br&gt;&quot;Power can be seized, but authority must be given.&quot; —&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://dice.camp/@johnzajac&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;johnzajac&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Misincarnated Martian • Liegehuman to guinea pigs • Let\'s not crash the biosphere, plzKthx • pronouns: 🤷&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wandering.shop/tags/StarTrek&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;StarTrek&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://wandering.shop/tags/GuineaPigs&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;GuineaPigs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://wandering.shop/tags/Stargate&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Stargate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://wandering.shop/tags/Sense8&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Sense8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://wandering.shop/tags/ScienceFiction&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;ScienceFiction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Avi: blue &amp;amp; red Yin/Yang symbol, transected by black &amp;amp; white question marks. Profile img: colorful weaving as a spider might embroider if she was on an acid trip.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2019-08-08 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="109314719785101432" label="109314719785101432">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109314719785101432', 'username': 'kellyromanych', 'followers': 1041, 'following': 1059, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Advocate. Writer. Posts on environment, justice, and equity. I resist, dissent, and mask. I live on the traditional territory of the Kizh Nation. Former first responder, educator, and nonprofit leader. Views are my own.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Avatar: sunflower with yellow petals unfurling like a heart&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Header: orange California poppies in morning sun&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/climate&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;climate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/disasters&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;disasters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/NativePlants&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;NativePlants&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/pollinators&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;pollinators&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/NativeBees&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;NativeBees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/bloomscrolling&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;bloomscrolling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/nonprofits&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;nonprofits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/philanthropy&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;philanthropy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/antiracism&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;antiracism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/equity&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/tags/justice&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;justice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-09 00:00:00'}" />
