          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '110101000248939313', 'username': 'NewsDesk', 'followers': 13328, 'following': 646, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;We share stories, explainers and analysis to offer context for the top news of the day. All posts are created and curated by Flipboard’s editorial team especially for Mastodon. Not a bot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Boosts do not imply endorsement, but are used to highlight posts we think the community might find interesting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For much more news, follow Flipboard\'s federated News Desk (&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://flipboard.com/@thenewsdesk&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;thenewsdesk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;) and Politics Desk (&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://flipboard.com/@ElectionCentral&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;ElectionCentral&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get the Flipboard app to explore all your interests in one place: &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.flipboard.com/download-flipboard/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;about.flipboard.com/download-f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;lipboard/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Header photo: A newsstand. Photo by AP.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2023-03-22 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
