          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '111543858640168242', 'username': 'MxVerda', 'followers': 932, 'following': 1609, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;I do art, games, and ranting. &lt;a href=&quot;https://lgbtqia.space/tags/OortArtCloud&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;OortArtCloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://positive.news&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;positive.news&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; has good stuff. I care about people. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I hate Long Covid. Wear your respirator properly. &lt;a href=&quot;https://omnimask.com&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;omnimask.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://teenvogue.com&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;teenvogue.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I’m AuHD. I often phrase things in ways people don’t expect. (Apparently.)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Brits assume I’m white american, but I’m also latinx / latine. Make of it what you will.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pfp is curly green hair. Banner is drawing of UK road intersection. &lt;br&gt;NSFW &lt;a href=&quot;https://subscribestar.adult/mxverde&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;subscribestar.adult/mxverde&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://lgbtqia.space/tags/vNSFW&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;vNSFW&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2023-12-07 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
