          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113698969690115979', 'username': 'MatthewToadAgain', 'followers': 174, 'following': 87, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Back office climate activist with a background in tech. Autistic, grey ace/aro spectrum, etc. I want to see socialism and radical climate action, but I oppose eugenics and eco-fascism. Israel out of Gaza and Russia out of Ukraine. All our major crises are connected to the climate and biodiversity crisis.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Intersectionality matters, I try to boost other marginalised groups. Occasional tech and jobs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;My last account was MatthewToad43 on this server.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2024-12-22 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="109273352232731189" label="109273352232731189">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109273352232731189', 'username': 'skaphle', 'followers': 157, 'following': 319, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Human &lt;a href=&quot;https://social.tchncs.de/tags/nobot&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;nobot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; climate justice activist based in Dresden, Germany. DE/EN&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tries hospicing modernity. Searches for utopias in collapse, or at least less violent futures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Interests include: antifascism, anarchism, socialism, internationalism, intersectionality, direct action, solidarity prepping, nonviolent communication, free software.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I\'d like to debate less about Israel and Palestine. I mute for dehumanization, double standards and rage bait.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(Englische bio wegen Zeichenlimit)&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-02 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
