          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '112244777576621584', 'username': 'mads', 'followers': 465, 'following': 2056, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Allegedly a dragon disguised as a game designer. Up to AAA shenanigans by day and indie by night. Hobbyist artist, sporadic writer, side project collector. Tarheel in bittersweet exile in the PNW. Proud, irreverant queer. On fedi since Nov \'22.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;New game coming soon! :sunface: &lt;a href=&quot;https://fedi.mvpgame.dev/tags/TSBYN&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;TSBYN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Death before detransition. Fix your hearts or die. 🏳️\u200d⚧️&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://fedi.mvpgame.dev/tags/NoBot&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;NoBot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://fedi.mvpgame.dev/tags/NoAI&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;NoAI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://fedi.mvpgame.dev/tags/NoSearch&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;NoSearch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://fedi.mvpgame.dev/tags/NoBridge&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;NoBridge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2024-04-10 00:00:00'}" />
