          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '1276256', 'username': 'Hex', 'followers': 1924, 'following': 1723, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Raised by wolves until I was old enough to know better. XML weapons specialist &amp;amp; digital locksmith.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I know things are bad, but we can make them better.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Half of what I post is just me repeating what QTBIPOC comrades have said in my whitest cisthet voice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fuck fascism and cars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Typo catches and clarifying questions always welcome. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;searchable via tootfinder.ch&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cybernetic Disaster Anarchist&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2020-09-14 00:00:00'}" />
