      <node id="111790641115970271" label="111790641115970271">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '111790641115970271', 'username': 'alshra', 'followers': 763, 'following': 1512, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;&quot;This is your true aspect, bright child -- the Alshra is truth&quot; - Neuri, Excalibur #46&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Baby trans girl in a middle-aged body full of magic and ✨ sparkles ✨\u200b trying to put some &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.lgbt/tags/love&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;love&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; out into the world ❤️&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Big fan of &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.lgbt/tags/memes&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;memes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.lgbt/tags/DadJokes&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;DadJokes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.lgbt/tags/puns&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;puns&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.lgbt/tags/Marvel&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Marvel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.lgbt/tags/WebDev&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;WebDev&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.lgbt/tags/MtG&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;MtG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.lgbt/tags/DnD&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;DnD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.lgbt/tags/Sonic&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Sonic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and other forms of nerdery.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Besides being terminally online, I also enjoy &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.lgbt/tags/jazz&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;jazz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.lgbt/tags/sailing&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;sailing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.lgbt/tags/doggos&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;doggos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.lgbt/tags/maps&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;maps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.lgbt/tags/cooking&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;cooking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Follow me for no recipes. 😁&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Believer in &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.lgbt/tags/RadicalPositivity&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;RadicalPositivity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. We\'re stronger together! ❤️\u200b&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Follows and boosts welcome! 🔄 Spread the &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.lgbt/tags/love&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;love&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;! ❤️&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2024-01-20 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
