          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109286034227862284', 'username': 'davej', 'followers': 646, 'following': 1671, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Formerly @il_beavo of Twitter. Previous lives in politics, hospitality, and coercing people onto—but not under—trains.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bereft catparent. Carer by necessity. Roleplayer by avocation. Australian by birth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ethnically Gen-X/culturally Millennial. Less an agent of chaos than a deniable asset. Through my nostrils I exhale the horror of the lonely places of the earth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Searchable via Tootfinder.&lt;br&gt;I boost a lot. See just my toots at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justmytoots.com/@davej@dice.camp&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://www.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;justmytoots.com/@davej@dice.ca&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;mp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-05-03 00:00:00'}" />
