          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109365893243244781', 'username': 'fsinn', 'followers': 2885, 'following': 1639, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Grateful for much and many. &lt;br&gt;Believer in the Rule Of Law.  &lt;br&gt;Defender of truth. &lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/TeamDemocracy&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;TeamDemocracy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/TeamHumanRights&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;TeamHumanRights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/AbortionIsAPrivacyIssue&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;AbortionIsAPrivacyIssue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/AbortionIsHealthcare&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;AbortionIsHealthcare&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Intellectual Property Lawyer, L.L.B. ‘98,&lt;br&gt;B.A. ‘92 Political Science &amp;amp; Economics&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Images are my own unless otherwise identified.  &lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/1000Breaths&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;1000Breaths&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;My opinions do not represent the views of any other individual nor any client. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;@mcfslaw &amp;amp; @SinnFrancisca on the bird app&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;she/her&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-11 00:00:00'}" />
