          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109345931599657482', 'username': 'BruceMirken', 'followers': 2413, 'following': 682, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Writer and media relations consultant for several organizations, but all ravings here are strictly mine. Known troublemaker, transplanted from California to Hilo, Hawaii. I often post pics of the cute &lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/reptiles&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;reptiles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; who hang out around my house. Escapee from &lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/Xitter&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Xitter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.  Do NOT patronize Elon Musk\'s businesses.&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/RacialJustice&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;RacialJustice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/LGBTQ&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;LGBTQ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/TransLivesMatter&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;TransLivesMatter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/EnvironmentalJustice&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;EnvironmentalJustice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/BlackLivesMatter&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;BlackLivesMatter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/ImpeachRFKJr&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot