          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '112298630735344076', 'username': 'SueDiOh', 'followers': 228, 'following': 312, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Okay I&amp;#39;ll conform to doing the bio thing under protest, and because at this time I only have 64 followers, probably because I look like a bot. &lt;br /&gt;Mom, grandma, sister, aunt, cousin, neighbor, friend.&lt;br /&gt;Michigan woman, but lived in the Great City of Pittsburgh for 30 years. Retired, so I can go see my kids &amp;amp; grands in different states whenever I want.&lt;br /&gt;Rather independent, if you couldn&amp;#39;t tell. Sometimes silly; often sarcastic.&lt;br /&gt;My other account is Suedioh77@mas.to&lt;br /&gt;I like trees.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2024-04-19 00:00:00'}" />
