          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113071095904337031', 'username': '504DR', 'followers': 852, 'following': 478, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Realist. Doomer. Planet first.&lt;br&gt;Born at 2.8 B world pop.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bernie Democrat.&lt;br&gt;Known to use curse words.&lt;br&gt;Known to post unpopular truths.&lt;br&gt;I match the energy I receive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I have seen the whole of the moon.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Toots delete/60 days.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&quot;Nature bats last.&quot;&lt;br&gt;Guy McPherson &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/ClimateCrisis&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;ClimateCrisis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/EcologicalOvershoot&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;EcologicalOvershoot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/Overpopulation&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Overpopulation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/OverConsumption&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;OverConsumption&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/HomoColossus&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;HomoColossus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/BiodiversityLoss&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;BiodiversityLoss&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/Antifascism&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&