          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109734730655443810', 'username': 'KE0FFT', 'followers': 892, 'following': 1030, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;I have a few hobbies. This feed is *mostly* &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.hams.social/tags/HamRadio&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;HamRadio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;(+) and &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.hams.social/tags/ShortwaveListening&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;ShortwaveListening&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.hams.social/tags/KE0FFTswl&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;KE0FFTswl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Will forward Midwest + Ohio Valley + some southern hazardous weather alerts, &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.hams.social/tags/POTA&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;POTA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; / &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.hams.social/tags/CQDX&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CQDX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; spots here. ~ Check out &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.hams.social/tags/HamRadioSolutions&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;HamRadioSolutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.hams.social/tags/VBand&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;VBand&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; site w/USB key adapter + &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.hams.social/tags/LCWO&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;LCWO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; = better CW. [&lt;a href=&quot;https://lcwo.net/profile/Skunkroot&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;lcwo.net/profile/Skunkroot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;] ~ Try &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.hams.social/tags/Morsle&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Morsle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Lifetime Member &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.hams.social/tags/LICW&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;LICW&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Updates on &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.hams.social/tags/HamRadioNets&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;HamRadioNets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; I monitor here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://bit.ly/3OA2Aed&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;bit.ly/3OA2Aed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ~ &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.hams.social/tags/AmateurRadio&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;AmateurRadio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; DMR/2m/70cm &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.hams.social/tags/Echolink&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Echolink&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.hams.social/tags/Allstar&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Allstar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ~  &lt;a href=&q