      <node id="109321887363928976" label="109321887363928976">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109321887363928976', 'username': 'OlDude82', 'followers': 983, 'following': 1887, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Banner: F-105F Wild Weasel over North Vietnam 1968. Been there; done that. I took  this picture&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Avitar: Caricature of old, bald man looking askance. Me! I created it long ago&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;College @ MissStateUniv;&lt;br&gt;20 years USAF (320 combat missions);&lt;br&gt;Soccer (20 yr player, 15 yr coach, once retail store owner);&lt;br&gt;Past Dir of FL Adoption Reunion Registry;&lt;br&gt;Computer Professional (consultant, developer, Sr. Software Engineer - data storage/access);&lt;br&gt;Angler (bass tournaments, now just fishing)&lt;br&gt;Thoroughly RETIRED&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-10 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113238358552460220" label="113238358552460220">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113238358552460220', 'username': 'gocu54', 'followers': 35, 'following': 1299, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Hi  there! I\'m Nick.  I\'m  26  years old,  a  college graduate and &lt;a href=&quot;https://caneandable.social/tags/Blind&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Blind&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. I\'m a massive  &lt;a href=&quot;https://caneandable.social/tags/Sports&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Sports&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; guy,  with my favorite teams being the &lt;a href=&quot;https://caneandable.social/tags/LosAngeles&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;LosAngeles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;   &lt;a href=&quot;https://caneandable.social/tags/Rams&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Rams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;,  &lt;a href=&quot;https://caneandable.social/tags/Dodgers&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Dodgers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://caneandable.social/tags/Lakers&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Lakers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. I\'m also a fan of &lt;a href=&quot;https://caneandable.social/tags/Gaming&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Gaming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  and I  also like making soundpacks for programs.     I  sometimes post  &lt;a href=&quot;https://caneandable.social/tags/Political&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Political&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  opinions and  some &lt;a href=&quot;https://caneandable.social/tags/NSFW&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;NSFW&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;   content here related to &lt;a href=&quot;https://caneandable.social/tags/Kink&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Kink&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;,   too  so  you\'ve been warned. I  hope to find more friends here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Signal;   &lt;a href=&quot;https://signal.me/#eu/rdtg40PfwPGGCOErQxVXU9EdQoePRoHayzhq3LY6eBlsglNeIFBJab0xS21YFnGE&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;signal.me/#eu/rdtg40PfwPGGCOEr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;QxVXU9EdQoePRoHayzhq3LY6eBlsglNeIFBJab0xS21YFnGE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2024-10-02 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
