          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109261026948960351', 'username': 'mttaggart', 'followers': 8917, 'following': 908, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Displaced Philly boy. Threat hunter. Educator. :ifin: Executive Director. &lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/tags/infosec&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;infosec&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/tags/programming&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/tags/rust&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;rust&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; :rust:, &lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/tags/python&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;python&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; :python: &lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/tags/haskell&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;haskell&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; :haskell:, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/tags/javascript&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;javascript&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; :javascript:. &lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/tags/opensource&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;opensource&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; advocate. General in the AI Resistance.  Runs &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/@thetaggartinstitute&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;thetaggartinstitute&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Made &lt;a href=&quot;https://wtfbins.wtf&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;wtfbins.wtf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Not your bro. All opinions my own. Dad. &lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/tags/fedi22&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;fedi22&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/tags/searchable&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;searchable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pronouns: He/him.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-04-26 00:00:00'}" />
