          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113310922799477831', 'username': 'Nonya_Bidniss', 'followers': 2738, 'following': 786, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Anti-clanker, anti-crypto, anti-fascist. Retired deep state IC/civil servant. Scientific &amp;amp; technical intelligence re pandemic threats, chem/bio weapons, bioscience, emerging tech; personal staff of senior GOs; tech writer, speech writer, senior editor; also worked at various analytic &amp;amp; research labs. Today I hike, cook, read &amp;amp; watch &lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/tags/scifi&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;scifi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Degrees in biology &amp;amp; strategic intelligence. Ham. Currently in N. Alabama :(  &lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/tags/veteran&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;veteran&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/tags/atheist&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;atheist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/tags/natsec&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;natsec&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 🌻#ActuallyAutistic &lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/tags/nobot&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;nobot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2024-10-14 00:00:00'}" />
