      <node id="109276925443011921" label="109276925443011921">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109276925443011921', 'username': 'johnb48', 'followers': 1801, 'following': 2576, 'bio': &quot;&lt;p&gt;I think of myself as an old hillbilly hippie. I've had several careers: Physics, personal counseling, computer science/software development. Unix/Linux. &lt;br&gt;Now I'm an old retired guy. I read a LOT. I think of myself as a liberal progressive politically. Some people know me as KB6QL.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I love the Grateful Dead. I love Gracie Slick. I also love the work of Johann Sebastian Bach. I have loved their work for more than 50 years. Oxford comma. Born at 310ppm CO2. &lt;br&gt;Whatever/whatever&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, 'created_at': '2022-11-02 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
