          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '108196012673194585', 'username': 'ELS', 'followers': 1167, 'following': 786, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Evolutionary Ecologist studying cooperation between bacteria and plants (and how phages might disrupt that cooperation). Sea kayaker passionate about protecting the terrestrial and marine environment. She/her/they/them. 315ppm&lt;br&gt;I star a post to express that I like it, that I hate it, that it alarms me, or to signal that I read it and appreciate that you exist. You choose!&lt;br&gt;,&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfba.social/tags/evolution&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;evolution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfba.social/tags/ecology&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;ecology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfba.social/tags/kayak&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;kayak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfba.social/tags/microbe&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;microbe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfba.social/tags/bacteria&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;bacteria&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfba.social/tags/phage&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;phage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfba.social/tags/plant&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;plant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfba.social/tags/botany&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;botany&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfba.social/tags/bicycle&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;bicycle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfba.social/tags/transit&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;transit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfba.social/tags/symbiosis&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;symbiosis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfba.social/tags/ecoev&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;ecoev&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-04-26 00:00:00'}" />
