          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109257952170643583', 'username': 'marion_grau', 'followers': 825, 'following': 3199, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Constructive theologian. Climate activist. Against authoritarianism, White supremacy, and misogyny. For democratic structures and a livable planet for all. (Mostly) sharing info of quality in English, German, Norwegian. She/her.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Image description: Smiling white woman holding a sign saying Fight the radical right. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://climatejustice.social/tags/climatejustice&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;climatejustice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://climatejustice.social/tags/petroreligion&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;petroreligion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://climatejustice.social/tags/ecotheo&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;ecotheo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://climatejustice.social/tags/energytransitions&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;energytransitions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://climatejustice.social/tags/energyjustice&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;energyjustice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://climatejustice.social/tags/ecocriticism&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;ecocriticism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://climatejustice.social/tags/petroculture&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;petroculture