          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109296278510958062', 'username': 'natureworks', 'followers': 2390, 'following': 1600, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Wildlife &amp;amp; forest garden designer, biodiversity assistant, in West Wales, UK. Climate activist. Professional ne’er do well. Commoner. Resistance is fertile. He/his.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/AntiFascist&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;AntiFascist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/ExtinctionRebellion&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;ExtinctionRebellion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/JustStopOil&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;JustStopOil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/UniversalBasicIncome&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;UniversalBasicIncome&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/UBI&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;UBI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/CitizensAssemblies&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CitizensAssemblies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/CommunityAssemblies&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CommunityAssemblies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/FreePublicTransport&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;FreePublicTransport&lt;/span&gt;&