          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109299002467373902', 'username': 'tiamat271', 'followers': 928, 'following': 1382, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Location: Colorado, USA&lt;br&gt;Hobbies: Currently working on my feminine rage \u2029&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/tags/NoKings&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;NoKings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/tags/Resist&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Resist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;\u2028\u2029Avatar description: An animated revolving large red circle with a line through it superimposed atop an image of a golden crown. (generously created by &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://hellions.cloud/@dannotdaniel&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;dannotdaniel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)\u2029Header description: Photo of an upside American flag hanging from the side of El Capitan in Yosemite National Park. Photo credit: Tracy Barbutes/San Francisco Chronicle.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-06 00:00:00'}" />
