          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109367490298216024', 'username': 'Scienceisnotopinions', 'followers': 634, 'following': 938, 'bio': &quot;&lt;p&gt;Retired nurse with two degrees . Fiction writer and health researcher spends a lot of time reviewing covid and other health information. You don't need a medical degree to follow the sceince:(&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I have followed the epidemiologists that have been right from the beginning, so don't shoot the messenger. I  take great care and time to forward this information. &lt;br&gt;If you are a fascist, I will block you!&lt;br&gt;If you share any conspiracy theories, I will block you.&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, 'created_at': '2022-11-18 00:00:00'}" />
