      <node id="109290489834621559" label="109290489834621559">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109290489834621559', 'username': 'lavergnetho', 'followers': 1681, 'following': 877, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;&quot;The climate we experience in the future depends on our decisions now&quot; - IPCC (2021)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I am a 🇨🇵-🇧🇻 scientist at the Norwegian Weather Service (#Oslo) : &lt;a href=&quot;https://fediscience.org/tags/satellite&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;satellite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href=&quot;https://fediscience.org/tags/seaice&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;seaice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for &lt;a href=&quot;https://fediscience.org/tags/osisaf&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;osisaf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://fediscience.org/tags/esa&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;esa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://fediscience.org/tags/copernicus&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;copernicus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://fediscience.org/tags/CIMR&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CIMR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Banner pic: an artist view of a satellite above Earth. This is the European CIMR satellite that will fly in the early 2030s.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I am trying to be better at &lt;a href=&quot;https://fediscience.org/tags/OpenScience&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;OpenScience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://fediscience.org/tags/Bass&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Bass&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; / &lt;a href=&quot;https://fediscience.org/tags/BassGuitar&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;BassGuitar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Opinions my own.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://fediscience.org/tags/NoBot&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;NoBot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://fediscience.org/tags/NoBots&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;NoBots&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-04 00:00:00'}" />
