.ca/tags/nobridge&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;nobridge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-06 00:00:00'}" />
