          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '108209993019225688', 'username': 'rustoleumlove', 'followers': 995, 'following': 487, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;I typically post about &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/tags/science&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;science&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/tags/news&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;news&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/tags/weather&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;weather&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/tags/climate&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;climate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, equal rights advocacy, &amp;amp; how terrible the police are. Some &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/tags/travel&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;travel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; flower photos too.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I\'ve worked as a chef, baker, molecular biologist, &amp;amp; freelance writer. even delivered newspapers from a bicycle as a kid if you wanna know i\'m old.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Art, graffiti, travel (100 countries &amp;amp; 50 states) museums, national parks, trains, &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/tags/photography&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;photography&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, tea, &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/tags/sewing&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;sewing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, reading, cooking, crochet, &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/tags/cycling&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;cycling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, cannabis, dogs, &amp;amp; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/tags/antiracism&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;antiracism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; are some of my interests&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-04-28 00:00:00'}" />
