          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109295237566158153', 'username': 'Gurre', 'followers': 1546, 'following': 1624, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Uppland expat in Sörmland.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&quot;YIMBY movement, let\'s start one!&quot; -me, 2007&lt;br&gt;One of the founders of the Yimby movement, I guess.&lt;br&gt;Day job: Database Engineer, primarily using PostgreSQL&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Languages i actually speak: Swedish &amp;amp; English. &lt;br&gt;Views expressed here are personal ones.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.nu/tags/yimby&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;yimby&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.nu/tags/housing&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;housing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.nu/tags/science&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;science&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.nu/tags/urbanism&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;urbanism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.nu/tags/transportation&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;transportation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.nu/tags/UrbSth&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;UrbSth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.nu/tags/08bygg&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;08bygg&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.nu/tags/WilliamsSyndrome&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&qu