      <node id="109304863828266555" label="109304863828266555">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109304863828266555', 'username': 'Edelruth', 'followers': 1288, 'following': 2977, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Ethicity: Born Irish Catholic.&lt;br&gt;Born at 314 ppm carbon (Nature Conservatory &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nature.org/en-us/get-involved/how-to-help/carbon-footprint-calculator/carbon-by-birth-year/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://www.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;nature.org/en-us/get-involved/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;how-to-help/carbon-footprint-calculator/carbon-by-birth-year/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;). It\'s 421.5 today - make that 430 😳&lt;br&gt;( &lt;a href=&quot;https://science.nasa.gov/earth/explore/earth-indicators/carbon-dioxide/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;science.nasa.gov/earth/explore&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;/earth-indicators/carbon-dioxide/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; )&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;She/her&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Recommend: Get Your Covid &amp;amp; Flu Shot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I do not use AI to write my posts. 🤓&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Retired RN, Central California. &lt;br&gt;I\'m interested in everything.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I boost liberally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I don\'t click on your bsky links because they are too much work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tickcounter.com/countdown/6239777/trump-legitimate-term-2&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://www.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;tickcounter.com/countdown/6239&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;777/trump-legitimate-term-2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://fedi.tips/how-do-i-search-for-stuff-on-mastodon/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;fedi.tips/how-do-i-search-for-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;stuff-on-mastodon/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-07 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
