      <node id="113520208367936687" label="113520208367936687">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113520208367936687', 'username': 'MikeH', 'followers': 59, 'following': 149, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;“Hello, good evening, and welcome”, as &lt;a href=&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Frost&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;David Frost&lt;/a&gt; used to say. This is my fourth fediverse account and therefore my fourth &lt;a href=&quot;https://transfem.social/tags/introduction&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#introduction&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt; so I should know what to put by now, unfortunately I still have no clue. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I\'ve been on various social media sites over the years. It all started way back in 1990 when I did the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://transfem.social/tags/OU&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#OU&lt;/a&gt; DT200 information technology course. This gave me access to their CoSy based conferencing system. From there I explored various &lt;a href=&quot;https://transfem.social/tags/BBSs&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#BBSs&lt;/a&gt; before joining &lt;a href=&quot;https://transfem.social/tags/CIX&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#CIX&lt;/a&gt;. From there I migrated to &lt;a href=&quot;https://transfem.social/tags/Facebook&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#Facebook&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://transfem.social/tags/Twitter&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#Twitter&lt;/a&gt; via &lt;a href=&quot;https://transfem.social/tags/Usenet&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#Usenet&lt;/a&gt; and alt newsgroups. When He Who Shall Not Be Named took over Twitter I decided that it was time to move on and so joined the Fediverse. My first instance was mastodon.me.uk. I followed quite a few people who were on various Misskey forks though and decided that I too wanted to play with all the &lt;i&gt;&lt;i&gt;cool&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span&gt; MFM tricks and so moved to shonk.social (RIP). Later I was invited by soph@ice.sophari.org to join her instance. That account still exists and I’ll be hanging on to it for the foreseeable future.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;My interests cover a variety of areas such as: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://transfem.social/tags/Cats&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#Cats&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://transfem.social/tags/Photography&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#Photography&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://transfem.social/tags/Cooking&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#Cooking&lt;/a&gt;. Recently, I’ve taken up art using &lt;a href=&quot;https://transfem.social/tags/Krita&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#Krita&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://transfem.social/tags/music&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#music&lt;/a&gt; using &lt;a href=&quot;https://transfem.social/tags/LMMS&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#LMMS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt; so, once I get myself sorted with them, I’ll be posting pictures and music from time to time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;That’s probably more than enough waffle from me but if there’s anything else you want to know just ask, I promise that I don\'t bite.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2024-11-21 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="109437241295092229" label="109437241295092229">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109437241295092229', 'username': 'Condorito', 'followers': 194, 'following': 735, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Nerd, engineer, husband and dad to a kid with &lt;a href=&quot;https://mindly.social/tags/downsyndrome&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;downsyndrome&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and another newish baby. Hoping that the mid to late 90s chat room vibe of Mastadon is here to stay.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-27 00:00:00'}" />
