          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109338369337571925', 'username': 'TalktoBeverley', 'followers': 814, 'following': 834, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;People puzzle me more each day that passes.&lt;br&gt;Left.  Definitely on the &lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/left&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;left&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Join a union.  &lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/SocialJustice&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;SocialJustice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/Unions&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Unions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/TUC&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;TUC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/COVIDhermit&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;COVIDhermit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/COVIDsafe&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;COVIDsafe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/WearaMask&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;WearaMask&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Be kind, wear a smile; it feels good. &lt;br&gt;❤️NE (UK) - My home; my heritage.  &lt;br&gt;Leeds University alumna.&lt;br&gt;Refugee from dead-bird site.  People, why do you stay?&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mas.to/tags/WhitleyBay&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;WhitleyBay&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-13 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
