          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '417105', 'username': 'drwho', 'followers': 594, 'following': 1130, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Living 20 minutes into the future. Eccentric weirdo. Virtual Adept. Time traveler. Burnout. Thelemite. Technomage. Hacker on main. APT 3319. BOFH. Not human. 30% software and implants. H+ - 0.4 on the Berram-7 scale. Furry adjacent. Pan/poly. Cyberpunk. Slightly improbable. SABLE. My code starts with 4GH. Sburb speedrunner. XKCD 705. Certified moopsy handler. Ohtori Academy alumnus. Magneto was right. Lil alurl velve zhah lil velkyn uss.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(Avatar by Avery Liell-Kok.)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;⚪&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2018-10-03 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
