      <node id="109363452668139100" label="109363452668139100">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109363452668139100', 'username': 'digitalrodent', 'followers': 1134, 'following': 1589, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Scientist by day, nerd at night. \u2028Burrowing into the virtual prairies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Professionally involved in &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Biology&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Biology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/EnvironmentalScience&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;EnvironmentalScience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Recreationally interested in &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/SciFi&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;SciFi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/StarTrek&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;StarTrek&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 🖖🏼#DoctorWho &amp;amp; &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Fantasy&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Fantasy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. I’m big into the &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Outdoors&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Outdoors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  and &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Nature&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Nature&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. I enjoy &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Birding&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Birding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Hiking&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Hiking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Botany&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Botany&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I am owned by my &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Cats&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Cats&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. 🐈\u200d⬛ I’m a happily married member of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/LGBTQ&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;LGBTQ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; community. 🏳️\u200d🌈&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-18 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
