          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109357065300528190', 'username': 'Turntwo363', 'followers': 645, 'following': 633, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Focused on eliminating fascism from America and the world! ❌👑 FDR Democrat. ♀️≥♂️ &lt;a href=&quot;https://mstdn.social/tags/Resist&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Resist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mstdn.social/tags/BlackLivesMatter&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;BlackLivesMatter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 🌈Ally &lt;a href=&quot;https://mstdn.social/tags/Healthcare4All&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Healthcare4All&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mstdn.social/tags/TrustScience&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;TrustScience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mstdn.social/tags/Geographer&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Geographer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mstdn.social/tags/OregonStateUniversity&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;OregonStateUniversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mstdn.social/tags/GoBeavs&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;GoBeavs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;🦫&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mstdn.social/tags/NoBridge&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;NoBridge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Also me...&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mstdn.social/tags/Oregon&qu