      <node id="112113438086154108" label="112113438086154108">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '112113438086154108', 'username': 'mogul', 'followers': 825, 'following': 410, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/civictech&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;civictech&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/agile&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;agile&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/product&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/tech&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;tech&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; wrangler&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Recently in the &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/WhiteHouse&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;WhiteHouse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/CEQ&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CEQ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and now speeding up &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/Permitting&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Permitting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;... while still in the &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/US&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/GSA&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;GSA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/TechnologyTransformationServices&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;TechnologyTransformationServices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, overseeing &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/platforms&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;platforms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/compliance&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for grants and regulations...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;...right after founding &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/clouddotgov&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;clouddotgov&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; at &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/18F&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;18F&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and working on &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/datadotgov&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;datadotgov&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;...right after surviving 16 years of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/ConsoleWars&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;ConsoleWars&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; at &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/PlayStation&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;PlayStation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;...right after 5 years of &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/GameDev&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;GameDev&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; as the lead programmer +co-designer of  &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/GrimFandango&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;GrimFandango&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; at &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/LucasArts&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;LucasArts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2024-03-16 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="1296149" label="1296149">
