          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '1296149', 'username': 'axolotl', 'followers': 508, 'following': 537, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Technochinampero. Gringo en Mexico. Indigenous communities rising up gives me hope. Bicycle for all occasions. // bici para toda ocasión.  Solidarity and mutual-aid. Bilingüe down to translate radical texts. Fascists gonna lose.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/anarchism&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;anarchism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/anarquismo&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;anarquismo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/activism&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;activism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/acab&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;acab&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/opensource&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;opensource&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/foss&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;foss&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/antifa&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;antifa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/nobots&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;nobots&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/noindex&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;noindex&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/tags/noai&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;noai&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2020-10-16 00:00:00'}" />
