      <node id="113841652402708402" label="113841652402708402">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113841652402708402', 'username': 'clew', 'followers': 1138, 'following': 920, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/Soil&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Soil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, ecology, low-input &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/MarketGardening&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;MarketGardening&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, women\'s history, material history, math, programming, literature of the long nineteenth, &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/waltz&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;waltz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/polka&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;polka&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, leavened bread.  Mostly around the Salish Sea. I am also pnw.zone/@clew for really local posts. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Profile image looks grayscale but is a color photo; a gull on a gray day here is just that gray. Header, for contrast,  is an edible-flower harvest, punnets of brilliant oranges and purply-blues and pinks, on a scrubbed washpack table.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2025-01-16 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
