      <node id="109362204992809062" label="109362204992809062">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109362204992809062', 'username': 'RufusJCooter', 'followers': 274, 'following': 595, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Mastodon, eh?&lt;br&gt;Middle-aged, cis-het white guy; my experience has been that the more we amplify the voices of those who don\'t fall neatly into those categories, the better. So that\'s what I try to do.&lt;br&gt;FYI: if I see you scolding someone for mastodonning wrong (i.e., &quot;We don\'t do threads on Mastodon!&quot; &quot;You need to tag your b/w photos as colorless!&quot; &quot;This discussion of racism needs to be hidden behind a content warning!&quot;) I will block you.&lt;br&gt;also @RufusJCooter@mstdn.so&lt;br&gt;searchable&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-18 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="109377222506552727" label="109377222506552727">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109377222506552727', 'username': 'KayseeColorado', 'followers': 759, 'following': 1190, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;I\'ve been as far south as 65°, as far north as 71°. Climbed as high as 5047 meters and  descended 313 meters below ground. I Collect volcanos, waterfalls and lighthouses.  &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/CarlSagan&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CarlSagan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is my hero.  I like birds. Love &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/history&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;history&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/StephenKing&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;StephenKing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. I travel. I snap pictures. All pictures posted are mine. &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Waterfall&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Waterfall&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Nature&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Nature&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Volcano&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Volcano&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Bird&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Bird&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Photography&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Photography&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Travel&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Travel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Lighthouse&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Lighthouse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Wildlife&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Wildlife&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/hiking&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;hiking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/cooking&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;cooking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-19 00:00:00'}" />
