      <node id="109379589335077582" label="109379589335077582">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109379589335077582', 'username': 'jelgato', 'followers': 70, 'following': 106, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Living in my own private Neo Tokyo. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Escape artist, automath, apostate &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.world/tags/vegetarian&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;vegetarian&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (orthodox - before the vegan reformation). Currently waiting a war against auto-complete and roaming the Pacific Northwest in search of the perfect bowl of pho.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.world/tags/HouseDavion&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;HouseDavion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.world/tags/TeamBanzai&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;TeamBanzai&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, occasional musings on contemporary politics and the looming &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.world/tags/EndOfTheWorld&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;EndOfTheWorld&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-20 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="112764522157531539" label="112764522157531539">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '112764522157531539', 'username': 'RandomCanuck', 'followers': 1054, 'following': 2420, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;🇨🇦 citizen, 🇺🇦 supporter. Toy poodle staffer since 1994. VE3ZDN&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&quot;We must build dikes of courage to hold back the flood of fear.&quot; - MLK Jr.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Born at 320 ppm CO2&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Vaxxed to the max&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Avatar: A raised fist with a Canadian flag overlayed.  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Header banner: A vintage style QSO card with my call sign in bold red letters. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cosocial.ca/tags/Canada&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Canada&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://cosocial.ca/tags/CanPoli&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CanPoli&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://cosocial.ca/tags/OnPoli&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;OnPoli&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://cosocial.ca/tags/Poodles&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Poodles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://cosocial.ca/tags/GTi&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;GTi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://cosocial.ca/tags/HamRadio&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;HamRadio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://cosocial.ca/tags/Ham&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Ham&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;@petrichorgrasshopper:matrix.org&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2024-07-10 00:00:00'}" />
