          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109288262748415807', 'username': 'nrohluap', 'followers': 198, 'following': 302, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Just another human looking to build community and share without making yet another techbro a billionaire. &lt;br&gt;\u2028Cybersecurity professional. \u2028Family guy. &lt;br&gt;Human for three (yes, three again!) crazy dogs. &lt;br&gt;Cyclist.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deep in the suburbs of Los Angeles. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;he/him&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Always read the Alt-text 😉&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ioc.exchange/tags/InfoSec&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;InfoSec&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://ioc.exchange/tags/OpSec&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;OpSec&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://ioc.exchange/tags/CyberSecurity&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CyberSecurity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ioc.exchange/tags/MastoDogs&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;MastoDogs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://ioc.exchange/tags/DogsOfMastodon&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;DogsOfMastodon&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ioc.exchange/tags/BikeTooter&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;BikeTooter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://ioc.exchange/tags/Cycling&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Cycling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-