          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109362112631791878', 'username': 'InfoNewsJunkie', 'followers': 87, 'following': 315, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;At 14 y/o I worked for a GOP political consulting firm. Made me a life long Democrat. Politics are my jam. I fight for social justice/civil rights/ACA &amp;amp; Mother Earth.  I garden to feed my soul, my family and my mental health.  I love art, architecture, archeology and history. Photography is my secret 💚. Climate change is real.  There’s no longer a wildfire season…it’s all year long for us.  Be prepared.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-18 00:00:00'}" />
