          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109289324054501375', 'username': 'dbaplanb', 'followers': 237, 'following': 699, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.sdf.org/tags/Translator&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Translator&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.sdf.org/tags/editor&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;editor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.sdf.org/tags/proofreader&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;proofreader&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.sdf.org/tags/Bosnian&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Bosnian&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.sdf.org/tags/Croatian&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Croatian&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.sdf.org/tags/Montenegrin&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Montenegrin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.sdf.org/tags/Serbian&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Serbian&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Stories, plays, memoir, misc. Recovering from 23 yrs of fulltime &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.sdf.org/tags/caregiving&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;caregiving&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for parents. Volunteer at Jewish Historical Society of Delaware. Former &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.sdf.org/tags/theater&quot; class=&quo