      <node id="109246457402563415" label="109246457402563415">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109246457402563415', 'username': 'j_g_fitzgerald', 'followers': 1488, 'following': 995, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://c.im/tags/FBPE&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;FBPE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 🇮🇪 🇪🇺citizen. &lt;a href=&quot;https://c.im/tags/GTTO&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;GTTO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://c.im/tags/FBR&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;FBR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://c.im/tags/FB&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;FB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;Vote Blue. Zero tolerance for neo-conservative cult. Liberal lefties are smarter &amp;amp; have more fun. Proactive planning for home building, affordable healthcare  &amp;amp; new social contract.&lt;br&gt;♥️ Munster rugby. &lt;br&gt;Fav movie; The Big Lebowski. Other movies may be approved. Fav books too numerous to list.&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://c.im/tags/SlavaUkraini&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;SlavaUkraini&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;🇺🇦&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://c.im/tags/GreenEnergy&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;GreenEnergy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://c.im/tags/Green&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Green&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://c.im/tags/PlantMoreTrees&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;PlantMoreTrees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://c.im/tags/Wexford&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Wexford&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://c.im/tags/UI&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;UI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://c.im/tags/Trees&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Trees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-10-28 00:00:00'}" />
