          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109565831055867076', 'username': 'Geoffberner', 'followers': 1959, 'following': 3371, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Jewish singer/songwriter/accordion player/novelist/some kind of activist maybe. Living on territory belonging to the Musqueam, Squamish and Tseil Waututh peoples. Pronouns: He/Him. &lt;a href=&quot;https://zeroes.ca/tags/COVIDisAirborne&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;COVIDisAirborne&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://zeroes.ca/tags/Wearamask&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Wearamask&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;a href=&quot;https://zeroes.ca/tags/Defundthepolice&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Defundthepolice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. www.geoffberner.com &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Profile pic is the flag of the old Yiddish Bund--a black square ringed in gold on a red field.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-12-23 00:00:00'}" />
