          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '1351178', 'username': 'joenepraat', 'followers': 2033, 'following': 1492, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;✭ about me: undogmatic (socialist) anarchist ☆ intersectional ☆ radical leftist activist ☆ climate alarmist ☆ anti-capitalist ☆ anti-fascist ☆ anti-zionist ☆ anti-militarist (not pacifist) ☆ anti-tankie ☆ anti-campist ☆ neo-luddite ☆ pro-science ☆ :autism: autistic ☆ :enby: :pride: non-binary queer ☆ white (not proud) ☆ veggie ☆ atheist ☆ genx ☆ parent ☆ .nl ✭&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✭ posting about: politics, activism, current affairs, journalism, human rights, climate crisis, history, sociology, tech (linux, open source, fedi, anti-AI, etc), music (70s/80s/90s, prince, funk, etc), sci-fi, free culture, geography, meteorology, climatology, astronomy, sociology, anthropology, biology, etc ✭&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✭ no money for donations, sorry ✭&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✭ more fedi: &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://pix.joenepraat.nl/joene&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;joene&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; (Pixelfed) for pics from various travels ☆ &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://tube.todon.eu/c/joenetube/videos&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;joenetube&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; (Peertube) for various vids ✭&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✭ © :cc: BY-NC-SA 4.0. (only own (original) content) ✭&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://todon.nl/tags/NoBot&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;NoBot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://todon.nl/tags/NoAI&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;NoAI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&