el=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;science&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/education&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;education&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/healthcare&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;healthcare&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; will not make us a better country.  The #2024 &lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/tags/USA&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;USA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; election will live on as one of the great missteps in civilization.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-13 00:00:00'}" />
