        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109316971737074846', 'username': 'lcwheeler', 'followers': 385, 'following': 353, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Green Labs Shared Equipment Coordinator – CU Boulder. Interested in &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/ecology&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;ecology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/conservation&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;conservation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/restoration&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;restoration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/sustainability&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;sustainability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Background in &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/biochemistry&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;biochemistry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/evolutionary&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;evolutionary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; genetics of &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/plants&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;plants&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. I dabble in &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/ScientificProgramming&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;ScientificProgramming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/ComputationalModeling&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;ComputationalModeling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. I love &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/nature&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;nature&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/Photography&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Photography&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/hiking&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;hiking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/running&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;running&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/cycling&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;cycling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/reading&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;reading&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/writing&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;writing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/sewing&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;sewing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/botanizing&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;botanizing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/herping&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;herping&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecoevo.social/tags/learning&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;learning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. I believe social justice should be woven into the practice of science. Opinions my own.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-10 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
