        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109245840626544933', 'username': 'taichara', 'followers': 13, 'following': 688, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;(new: &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://turnipheap.loneknight.quest/@taichara&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;taichara&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REALITY.SYS corrupt.  reboot Universe?  [Y/N/Q]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Over here, I\'m mostly here for ttrpg things (thus on TableToot!), but if I get myself together and can branch out, there will be archaeology and nature and various dead/fossil things.  Also videogames, but those might just be me grumping, lol.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Definitely tabletop stuff, though.  &quot;OSR&quot;, 2e AD&amp;amp;D, the &quot;basic&quot; D&amp;amp;Ds, and my own ramblings, mostly, but I\'ll poke everything from Cairn to Exalted to Traveller.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-10-28 00:00:00'}" />
