      <node id="109538273533174465" label="109538273533174465">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109538273533174465', 'username': 'BaconSmith', 'followers': 124, 'following': 102, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;A long time ago, in a galaxy right here, I did a Ph.D. at Penn, studying lots of things (I once knew the country of tradition for the notches in log cabin construction, but that\'s another story).  Mostly studied writers and readers and the worlds they create between them. Now, I\'m an arts writer, fiction writer (contemporary fantasy, and epic fantasy as Curt Benjamin). &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Photography is art. Mad for dance--all kinds. Avatar is Man Ray with a camera (1932) &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/arts&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;arts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/dance&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;dance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/Ballet&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Ballet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://universeodon.com/tags/writers&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;writers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-12-19 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
