          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '108205789594068613', 'username': 'jwilker', 'followers': 884, 'following': 629, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Writer of fast/fun Sci-fi and action/adventure thrillers. &lt;br&gt;SciFi: Space Rogues, Rogue Enterprises and Grand Human Empire&lt;br&gt;Action/adventure thrillers:Expedition, Inc. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Member of &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wandering.shop/@SFWA&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;SFWA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, Codex, and CAL&lt;br&gt;Live in Denver, CO with my wife and adventure buddy, Paco, and our new little muppet: Princeton&lt;br&gt;He/Him &lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wandering.shop/tags/BLM&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;BLM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://wandering.shop/tags/spaceopera&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;spaceopera&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://wandering.shop/tags/scifibooks&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;scifibooks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://wandering.shop/tags/indieauthor&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;indieauthor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Check out all of my books here! &lt;a href=&quot;https://johnwilker.com/books&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;johnwilker.com/books&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-04-27 00:00:00'