          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '108197453935294138', 'username': 'silver_huskey', 'followers': 386, 'following': 286, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;I\'m the Executive Editor of Damage Control Blog and the founder of The Balto League, a Balto fan group. Black American | gamer | Balto fan | animation fan | tech enthusiast | furry | old school web fan. She/her. I\'m new to the decentralized web, but I fondly remember Web 1.0. &lt;a href=&quot;https://fandom.ink/tags/PFP&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;PFP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; by EmberWolfsArt. Header art by Panthera Arven. I\'m also on &lt;a href=&quot;https://fandom.ink/tags/fedi22&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;fedi22&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href=&quot;https://fandom.ink/tags/Gaming&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Gaming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://fandom.ink/tags/VideoGames&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;VideoGames&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://fandom.ink/tags/Livestreamer&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Livestreamer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://fandom.ink/tags/Anime&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Anime&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://fandom.ink/tags/Fandom&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Fandom&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-04-26 00:00:00'}" />
