      <node id="109304708441896427" label="109304708441896427">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109304708441896427', 'username': 'TheGreatLlama', 'followers': 310, 'following': 267, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Please note: whoever it is using &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/@TheGreatLlama&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;TheGreatLlama&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; over on birdchan, it isn\'t me. Make sure you insist on authentic, cage free, anti-authoritarian Llama: you\'ll taste the difference! Miscellaneous and disreputable vagrant, just here for a better way to stay informed. I can\'t help the motivations you assign to my words, but I assure you, I\'m trying to be kind. Sometimes I fail.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Inverted Y axis is the correct perspective and this is a hill I will die on.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-07 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="109309942551666887" label="109309942551666887">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109309942551666887', 'username': 'dmayhood', 'followers': 456, 'following': 730, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Aquatic ecologist. Watershed development effects, stream ecology, conservation biology of native trout in SW Alberta.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Header photo: Bow Lake, 1920 m/6300\', Banff National Park, Alberta, at ice-out 2022.06.17. Looking SW to (L-R): shoulder of Crowfoot Mtn, Vulture Pk (just visible w magnification), Mt Olive, St Nicholas Pk, Bow Glacier/Wapta Icefield. Out of displayed view R: Portal Pk, Mt Thompson.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In various ways, Bow watershed has formed me.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://fwresearch.ca&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;fwresearch.ca&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; [no longer kept current]&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-08 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
