      <node id="110663321951047531" label="110663321951047531">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '110663321951047531', 'username': 'aaron', 'followers': 561, 'following': 615, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;ex .lol ex kolektiva &quot;fbi take all our data lmao&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;More social less media, please be polite and read the pinned intro before deepdiving your presumptions about something I\'ve replied to, we\'ll get along fine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I don\'t see DMs unless we\'re mutuals. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cutie.city/tags/nobridge&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;nobridge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Current profile pic is a painting of a young boy with feathered hair, holding a toy dog, maybe a bear. The kid has a book too and is wearing a crushed velvet jacket with a large white scarf/blouson (it\'s from the 1800s maybe?). Text over reads &quot;I wasn\'t just gay. I was gay and weird&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2023-07-05 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
