        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113683494414963434', 'username': 'j', 'followers': 118, 'following': 200, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://janerationx.rocks/tags/GenX&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;GenX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, she/her. Likes &lt;a href=&quot;https://janerationx.rocks/tags/shoegaze&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;shoegaze&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://janerationx.rocks/tags/cats&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;cats&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Roots for &lt;a href=&quot;https://janerationx.rocks/tags/Lions&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Lions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://janerationx.rocks/tags/Mets&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Mets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Tends to &lt;a href=&quot;https://janerationx.rocks/tags/swear&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;swear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://janerationx.rocks/tags/fart&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;fart&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Kind of an acquired taste. Also, I hate peas and nazis.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Other interests: &lt;a href=&quot;https://janerationx.rocks/tags/Reading&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Reading&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://janerationx.rocks/tags/Writing&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; t