          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109281599484435365', 'username': 'hawaiianeye797', 'followers': 2221, 'following': 2836, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Forever a photojournalist. Retired nurse practitioner.  Enthusiastic documenter of sea life in &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/tags/Hawaii&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Hawaii&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  Photos my own or properly attributed. Hopeful for a better and healthy planet. &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/tags/journalism&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;journalism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/tags/photojournalism&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;photojournalism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/tags/C2PA&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;C2PA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Prints available for some images. DM me.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Alt text Header:  A sea turtle with a rounded head, left fin extended and covered with a mosaic of dark leather-like markings, .&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Alt text avatar: An oblong golden and white fish with a dark mask and markings&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-11-03 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="109529113339744679" label="109529113339744679">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '109529113339744679', 'username': 'evan', 'followers': 12307, 'following': 2586, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;He/him. Board member at CoSocial.ca.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Research Director, Social Web Foundation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Author of &quot;ActivityPub: Programming for the Social Web&quot; from O\'Reilly Media.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Founder of Wikitravel, StatusNet, identi.ca, Fuzzy.ai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Creator of pump.io. Co-creator of GNU social.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Former co-chair of the Social Web Working Group at W3C. Co-author of Activity Streams 2.0. Co-author of ActivityPub. Co-author of OStatus.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grad student in CS at Georgia Tech.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Greek, Arab, Palestinian, American, Canadian, Montréalais.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2022-12-11 00:00:00'}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
