          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113302942420792050', 'username': 'punkonbuslives', 'followers': 2283, 'following': 1887, 'bio': '&lt;p&gt;Living in the fascist USA. I\'m here to talk &lt;a href=&quot;https://trekkies.social/tags/StarTrek&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;StarTrek&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and only Trek, except when I\'m not. When I say I love all Star Trek, I mean all: live action, animated, old, new. Captain in Starfleet International (www.sfi.org). Mensa member (but not a d-ck about it). And no, I am not the inimitable and inestimable Kirk R. Thatcher.&lt;/p&gt;', 'created_at': '2024-10-13 00:00:00'}" />
